      "source": [
        {
          "question": "q-83140",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "The outstanding amount $L(t)$ that Daphne needs to repay the bank $t$ years after taking out a loan can be modeled by the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}L}{\\text{d}t}=-0.5L.\n$$\n\nIf she borrowed $$32\\,000,$ calculate the debt remaining after $8$ years. Round your answer to the nearest dollar.",
          "category": "ma_capture",
          "file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14037533/state.json",
          "file_sha256": "904167c99e60b37b1d87c6cc667dff64d383a3e708f76875a3700ce863114bad"
        }
      ],
      "basis": 1272,
      "reason": "Observed MA content supersedes the stored value",
      "action": "replace",
      "transaction_receipt": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14037533/edb-import/commit.edn",
      "basis_after": 1273
    },
    {
      "question": "q-83140",
      "field": null,
      "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
      "old_sha256": "9f8c502745e192ad1e6f1ec4143430ffee246fdd9b10dbbd1618deb78b0605c0",
      "new_sha256": "a3141e8dd1fbedbe9bf752148167009a28c2f6e2b6ad6f0079d6730aee75430a",
      "category": "ma_capture",
      "authoring": [],
      "source": [
        {
          "question": "q-83140",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "We model the amount of debt remaining using the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}L}{\\text{d}t}=-0.5L.\n$$\n\nThe solution to this equation is\n\n$$\nL(t)={L}_{0}\\,{e}^{-0.5t},\n$$\n\nwhere ${L}_{0}$ is the initial value.\n\nWe're told that $$32\\,000$ were borrowed, so we have ${L}_{0}=32\\,000.$\n\nTherefore, the amount of debt $L$ remaining at time $t$ is\n\n$$\nL(t)=32\\,000\\,{e}^{-0.5t}\\,.\n$$\n\nFinally, to find the amount of debt remaining when $t=8,$ we substitute $t=8$ into the above, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(8) & =32\\,000\\,{e}^{-0.5\\cdot 8} \\\\  & =32\\,000\\,{e}^{-4} \\\\  & \u2248586.100\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRounding our answer to the nearest integer, we conclude that $586$ dollars of debt remain.",
          "category": "ma_capture",
          "file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14037533/state.json",
          "file_sha256": "904167c99e60b37b1d87c6cc667dff64d383a3e708f76875a3700ce863114bad"
        }
      ],
      "basis": 1272,
      "reason": "Observed MA content supersedes the stored value",
      "action": "replace",
      "transaction_receipt": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14037533/edb-import/commit.edn",
      "basis_after": 1273
