          "question": "e-542",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Suppose that the population $P(t)$ of a town after $t$ years can be modeled by the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}P} {\\textrm{d}t} = 0.02P.\n$$\n\nIf there are currently $500$ people in the town, what will be the town's population in $3$ years?",
